  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 736m² freehold site in a quiet cul-de-sac, this sun-drenched family home offers exceptional space, flexibility, and value. Designed across two levels, the layout perfectly caters to large or multi-generational families, smart investors, or those seeking ideal work-from-home options.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n• 4 Bedrooms & 2 Bathrooms: Flexible multi-level layout, including a large rumpus room currently configured as a generous master suite, plus full family bathrooms on both levels.\r\n\r\n• Versatile Bonus Rooms: Dedicated office space and a children’s playroom—ideal for work, study, storage, or kids' space.\r\n\r\n• Sunlit Indoor/Outdoor Living: Open-plan upper living area flowing seamlessly to a private deck, surrounded by a lush garden orchard of peaches, plums, apples, figs, mandarins, and bananas.\r\n\r\n• Parking & Storage: Single, enclosed carport plus ample off-street parking with dedicated room for a boat, caravan, or trailer.\r\n\r\n• Prime Long Bay Location: Easy walking distance to Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College; minutes to Torbay shops, Long Bay Village, Regional Park, and the beach.\r\n\r\nBig home, great value, call us today.",
